    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present No. 27 Thormanby lawns to the market. An impressive, detached family home, offering spacious and versatile accommodation extending to approximately 215 sq.m. Set on a generous site, this outstanding residence combines comfort, privacy, and convenience in Howth, one of Dublin's most sought-after coastal locations.\n\nDesigned for modern family living, the property enjoys bright and well-proportioned rooms throughout, complemented by a beautiful south-facing rear garden and excellent outdoor space.\n\nAccommodation comprises, spacious hallway, living room, kitchen/dining, utility, TV room, home office and guest w.c. While upstairs there are 4 double bedrooms, a store room, the main bedroom is ensuite and bedroom 2 and 3 share a 'Jack and Jill' ensuite and the family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe front cobblelock driveway can accommodate up to 6 cars and a side passage way leading to the back garden is gated both ends. The rear garden is landscaped to include outdoor dining patio, raised lawn, and has an outdoor room (12.2 sq.m.) which can be used as a home office/gym in addition to a block built garden shed to rear.\n\nThe location here is wonderful surrounded by hill, cliff and coastal walks and close to Howth Village with its great selection of cafes, restaurants, bars and other amenities. Renowned primary and secondary schools are in the area and all sporting facilities available including sailing, golf, rugby, football, GAA and tennis to name a few.\n\nTransport connections include the bus on Thormanby Road and DART at Howth. Dublin Airport is about half an hour's drive away.\n\nViewing is advised to appreciate all this wonderful home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 5.67m x 3.54m\nSpacious hallway, tiled flooring, recessed lights, security alarm panel\n\nLiving Room - 6.64m x 3.63m\nTwo large picture windows to front, carpet, feature open fireplace, recessed lights, TV point\n\nKitchen/Dining - 8.70m x 4.04m\nGreat selection of kitchen cabinets and kitchen island with pull out drawer storage, integrated induction hob, double electric oven and grill, warming oven, corner full length fridge, Quooker kitchen tap, water softener system and insinkerator and undercounter freezer, recessed lights, tiled floor and splashback, sliding doors to garden, door to utility\n\nUtility Room - 2.67m x 2.52m\nStorage presses, fridge/freezer, washing machine, dryer, location of gas boiler, door to rear garden\n\nOffice - 2.92m x 4.77m\nCarpet, recessed lights, TV point, window to front\n\nTV Room - 3.15m x 3.94m\nCarpet, TV point, recessed lights, electric remote controlled wall-mounted fire\n\nGuest W.C. - 2.22m x 0.90m\nTiled floor, part tiled walls, w.c., wash hand basin, recessed lights\n\nLanding - 4.45m x 3.34m\nCarpet, recessed lights, door to hot press and store room\n\nStore Room - 1.95m x 3.13m\nStore room set into eaves and velux window, shelving and wardrobe, carpet, recessed lights\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.18m x 4.31m\nTo front, spacious double with two sets of built-in wardrobes, carpet, recessed lights\n\nEnsuite - 2.22m x 1.60m\nEnsuite shower room, fully tiled, w.c., wash hand basin, corner electric Mira shower, recessed lights, window to side\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.00m x 3.56m\nDaul aspect, with vaulted high ceiling, double bedroom with window to front and to rear, set of wardrobes, TV point, carpet, recessed lights, door to 'jack & Jill' ensuite\n\nEnsuite - 1.19m x 3.60m\nLarge tiled shower with rain shower, w.c, wash hand basin with storage press, heated towel rail, recessed lights, tiled floor\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.84m x 3.93m\nDouble to rear, carpet, TV point, built-in wardrobes, recessed lights\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.67m x 3.44m\nDouble to rear, built-in wardrobe, desk and shelving unit, recessed lights, oak wood flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.77m x 2.38m\nFully tiled, bath with shower hose and electric Mira shower overhead, perspex screen, w.c., wash hand basin, extractor far, mirrored wall mounted storage unit\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious Detached 4 Bedroom Home extending to approx. 215 sq.m. (2,314 sq.ft.)</li><li>Private Sunny South-Facing Garden</li><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>Double Glazed Windows Throughout</li><li>Detached Block-Built Outdoor Room/Home Office extending to approx. 12.2 sq.m.</li><li>Large Private Driveway with Parking for up to 6 Cars</li><li>Beside Communal Green Area </li><li>Close to Shops, Schools, Cafés, Restaurants and Bars</li><li>Wide Range of Sporting and Recreational Amenities Nearby</li><li>Surrounded by the Stunning Coastal, Hill and Cliff Walks of Howth</li><li>Bus on Thormanby Road and DART at Howth</ul>"
      },
